  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5soWQJH.png\" alt=\"trapdoorsmcw\" width=\"1075\" height=\"570\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCc_kqzt253fnG2RHW_CZL2A?label=Youtube&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"138\" height=\"22\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/sketch_macaw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/sketch_macaw?color=6eb7ec&amp;label=Twitter&amp;logo=twitter&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"119\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Jmpdj8W\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/645360921673465857?color=a97db2&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=f&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"181\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sketchmacaw/MacawsModsIssues/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/- -ffffff\" width=\"15\" height=\"28\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Crafting Recipes-bc8f56?style=for-the-badge\" width=\"154\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/A1pclRa.png\" alt=\"about\" width=\"162\" height=\"43\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你是否曾經想過，如果 Minecraft 的基本橡木活板門能擁有每種木材的變化，那該有多好？</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果是的話，那你來對地方了！Macaw's Trapdoor 為每種木材變化添加了原版活板門，而且</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還新增了全新的活板門。最新版本增加了新的牧場活板門、竹子活板門等等！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在下方留言區或我們的 Macaw's Discord 上提出你的想法吧。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zQ7I8me.png\" alt=\"video\" width=\"340\" height=\"47\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5rCpU9apUVw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/491l1m9yKTk?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fsketchmacaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Macaw/BH_MxBH_PromoCard.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"144\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">需要伺服器嗎？點擊上方圖片，使用我們的代碼 <strong>sketchmacaw</strong>，即可在第一個月享有<strong> 25% </strong>折扣，盡情暢玩！</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GUtHhCc.png\" alt=\"blueline\" width=\"1920\" height=\"17\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EpKoS1L.png\" alt=\"faq\" width=\"163\" height=\"50\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：你們有計劃向下移植到 1.15.2 及更早版本嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可能性很低，但或許未來某個時候會推出最後一個 1.12.2 版本。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我可以在我的模組包中使用你的模組嗎？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以，只需標註我們並附上 CurseForge 頁面的參考連結即可。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">問：我有一些翻譯想提供給你，應該寄到哪裡？</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">答：可以透過 Github 或我們的 Discord 伺服器提交。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Je5qUvD.jpg\" width=\"1125\" height=\"1477\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
